---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PostCard from '../components/PostCard.astro';
import { posts } from '../data/posts';
const lead = posts[0];
const latest = posts.slice(0, 6);
---
<Layout title="硬核极客测速站｜真实机场测速、晚高峰跑分与线路评测" description="硬核极客测速站提供真实机场测速截图、晚高峰跑分、Netflix 等流媒体解锁检测，以及 IPLC、IEPL、BGP 线路深度分析。">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <div class="shell hero-layout">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-badge"><span></span>独立测试 · 公开方法 · 持续复测</div>
        <h1>把每一次测速，<br/><em>变成可靠判断。</em></h1>
        <p>不拿凌晨峰值制造惊喜。我们关注晚高峰稳定性、持续丢包、流媒体播放和真实路由，为每个结论保留可验证的依据。</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="primary-action" href={`/posts/${lead.slug}/`}>阅读本月红黑榜</a><a class="secondary-action" href="/about/">了解测试方法</a></div>
        <div class="hero-proof"><div><strong>30+</strong><span>单节点采样</span></div><div><strong>4 周</strong><span>月度观察周期</span></div><div><strong>20:00</strong><span>晚高峰开始</span></div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-insight" aria-label="晚高峰测速数据示例">
        <div class="insight-photo"><span class="insight-photo-label">LAB / NODE 04</span></div>
        <div class="insight-body">
          <div class="insight-head"><div><span class="live-dot"></span><b>晚高峰表现快照</b></div><small>东京 · IEPL</small></div>
          <div class="insight-score"><div><strong>842.6</strong><span>Mbps</span><small>持续下载</small></div><div class="grade"><span>A</span><small>稳定度评级</small></div></div>
          <div class="smooth-chart" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 480 150" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path class="area" d="M0 108 C35 90 55 97 86 70 S135 58 166 65 S220 30 255 45 S310 80 340 53 S400 22 480 35 L480 150 L0 150Z"/><path class="line" d="M0 108 C35 90 55 97 86 70 S135 58 166 65 S220 30 255 45 S310 80 340 53 S400 22 480 35"/></svg><span>20:00</span><span>21:00</span><span>22:00</span><span>23:00</span></div>
          <dl class="insight-metrics"><div><dt>延迟</dt><dd>38.2 ms</dd></div><div><dt>抖动</dt><dd>2.1 ms</dd></div><div><dt>丢包</dt><dd>0.0%</dd></div></dl>
          <p class="sample-label">界面演示样本 · 正式报告附原始截图与时间戳</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="trust-strip"><div class="shell"><span>测试原则</span><p>固定环境</p><p>晚高峰采样</p><p>跨运营商复测</p><p>原始证据留档</p><p>结论标注有效期</p></div></section>

  <section class="section start-section">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-intro"><span>从哪里开始</span><h2>按你的问题，找到答案</h2><p>不需要先理解所有协议。选择你真正关心的问题，我们把复杂网络数据翻译成清晰判断。</p></div>
      <div class="start-grid">
        <a class="start-card ranking" href="/reviews/"><div class="soft-icon"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><small>稳定性与风险</small><h3>哪些服务值得长期用？</h3><p>查看月度红黑榜，了解晚高峰表现、节点可用率和运营风险。</p><b>查看本月榜单 <span>→</span></b></a>
        <a class="start-card config" href="/guides/"><div class="soft-icon"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><small>客户端与分流</small><h3>怎样把配置真正用好？</h3><p>从 DNS 到规则集，掌握 Sing-box、Clash Verge Rev 和 Loon。</p><b>进入实操教程 <span>→</span></b></a>
        <a class="start-card route" href="/routes/"><div class="soft-icon"><em></em><em></em><em></em></div><small>入口与回程</small><h3>线路标签到底怎么看？</h3><p>拆解 IPLC、IEPL、BGP 和上游机房，找到真实的性能瓶颈。</p><b>浏览线路分析 <span>→</span></b></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section latest-section" id="latest">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-intro row"><div><span>最新内容</span><h2>实测、教程与线路观察</h2></div><a href="/reviews/">查看全部文章 →</a></div>
      <div class="content-grid">{latest.map((post, index) => <PostCard post={post} index={index} featured={index === 0} />)}</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-band">
    <div class="shell feature-layout"><div><span>我们的判断标准</span><h2>好线路，不只是“测速快”。</h2><p>峰值速度只占结论的一部分。长期可用性来自稳定的延迟、低丢包、合理负载和清晰的服务响应。</p><a href="/about/">查看完整测试标准 →</a></div><div class="feature-points"><article><strong>01</strong><div><h3>持续稳定</h3><p>观察一段时间，而不是选择一张最好看的截图。</p></div></article><article><strong>02</strong><div><h3>实际可用</h3><p>结合网页、下载、会议和流媒体播放验证体验。</p></div></article><article><strong>03</strong><div><h3>风险透明</h3><p>标注数据边界，不承诺永久解锁或永远稳定。</p></div></article></div></div>
  </section>
</Layout>
